{"unit_id":"goecho__dsh-generation#card-zh","repo":"goecho/dsh-generation","commit":"778c5c2f5d57779e2d2e51f5f367d9c9584acd20","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-generation 是 DSH 的 Agent preset 世代协作插件。它注册 generation_fork 和 generation_run：前者复制现有 preset 并写入用途说明，后者在新会话挂载指定 preset、执行任务并返回运行摘要。插件为 Creator 会话提供提示，在操作前请求人工确认，并对非 Creator 会话和子 agent 隐藏工具。适合需要从已知配置创建专用工作 agent 并运行独立任务的用户。需从 Creator 模式会话调用；不需要额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:585-599","src/index.js:340-435","src/index.js:437-579"]}
{"unit_id":"goecho__dsh-generation#card-en","repo":"goecho/dsh-generation","commit":"778c5c2f5d57779e2d2e51f5f367d9c9584acd20","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-generation creates agent-preset generations in DSH. generation_fork copies a preset and records its purpose; generation_run starts a new session, runs a task, and returns a summary. It requires approval and Creator mode. No extra API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:585-599","src/index.js:340-435","src/index.js:437-579"]}
